Wikipedia quantum mechanics reading corpus

The article text and MathML in corpus.json are adapted from English Wikipedia,
written by Wikipedia contributors. This dataset is licensed separately from the
Rust code under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Each article record identifies its title, page ID, revision ID, revision timestamp,
retrieval timestamp, and hash of the retrieved revision HTML. Attribution and
contributor histories are available at:
  https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?curid=PAGE_ID&action=history
The version read is available at:
  https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=REVISION_ID
Substitute the numeric IDs from the article record.

Changes: selected paragraphs and standalone MathML were extracted; navigation,
reference lists, and most non-prose material were excluded. Whitespace was
normalized and long paragraphs split. Inline formulas were replaced by explicit
references to preserved source MathML, without interpreting the mathematics.
These changes are not endorsed by Wikipedia contributors. No images are copied.
Wikipedia content is revisable and may contain errors; inclusion does not verify
scientific claims. This corpus is not covered by the repository's MIT license.

